        <div class="drivers">Netanyahu runs as caretaker PM with the October 27 election set; Likud and Yashar (Eisenkot) are tied at 22–24 seats in August polls, giving Netanyahu strong personal incentive to remain in the race. The range accounts for the possibility of a legal or coalition-management development that makes a pre-election departure strategically rational, against the base case of Netanyahu contesting the election through EOD October 27.</div>
      </div>
